# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The east

step The Grimesilt outhouse
  tip From Thelsamar ride south into the Badlands, then west past the Horde town of Kargath (give it room) and up the trail into Searing Gorge: the Grimesilt Dig Site is just inside, in the south-east. The prisoner in the wooden outhouse wants 15 Silk Cloth and eight dead Dark Iron Geologists from the dig site around it. The outhouse also opens with the key, if you found one.
  accept 4449

step The Grimesilt outhouse
  kill 5839 quest 4449 @63.9,60.4 map 1427 -- Dark Iron Geologist
  collect 4306 x15 quest 4449 @63.9,60.4 map 1427 -- Silk Cloth
  turnin 4449
  note The prisoner's next task, Ledger from Tanaris, sends you to the Swamp of Sorrows and Dustwallow Marsh: skip it.

step Level 48.27
  when level<48.27
  tip If you skipped The Monogrammed Sash or Facing Negolash, grind here to level 48.27 to stay on the route's plan. Or, with a group, run the Maraudon dungeon or the Zul'Farrak dungeon instead.
  goto 63.3,60.6 map 1427 "Dark Iron Geologist"
  level 48.27 grind 5839               -- grind on Dark Iron Geologist

step Dorius Stonetender
  tip Dorius stands by the road beside the Grimesilt Dig Site. Escort him north-east to Dustfire Valley and keep him alive; when it is over, read the Singed Letter he leaves on the road.
  accept 3367
  complete 3367
  turnin 3367                         -- Singed Letter
  accept 3368                         -- For Curator Thorius in Ironforge, later

